  "description": "The Helium Frame took the race world by storm when we released it almost x5 years ago. With multiple World Championship wins, the Helium Frame is now a common site on tracks across the globe. Our flagship frame uses our very own forged dropout design which allows it to be fully disc-brake compatible when used with our Helium Disc Brake Mount. Available in a huge variety of sizes and some of our most vibrant and unique colours to date, there simply isn’t a better looking or feeling frame on the market than the Helium!\n\n• super lightweight alloy race frame\n• Hydroformed 6061 alloy tubing\n• forged & cnc machined dropouts\n• for 20” (451mm) x 1 1/8” tires\n• Will work with disc brake when used with the Radio Helium Expert Disc Brake Mount",
